[00:19.36]In this year of goodwill
[00:21.52]by our God, all need to hear
[00:28.98]That the day of his anger
[00:31.48]will come, and it is near.
[00:35.59](Chorus)
[00:35.74]It means their life, but not just theirs;
[00:42.74]It means our own life as well.
[00:47.52]It means their life if they obey,
[00:52.52]So all the nations we must tell;
[00:57.10]We must tell.
[01:07.36]There’s a message to preach,
[01:09.76]so we spread it all abroad.
[01:16.86]We invite all to come and
[01:19.48]be reconciled to God.
[01:24.47](Chorus)
[01:24.62]It means their life, but not just theirs;
